7
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:08.620
Made excuses out of worldly wisdom

8
00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:18.500
But clever words can't warm a weary soul

9
00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:25.180
Seek and you will find

10
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:31.840
